# Dual-land bugfixes

While a `release/*` branch is active (e.g. `release/0.0.1`), bugfixes and hotfixes must land on **both** that release branch and `develop`.

- Prefer committing on `release/*`, then run `scripts/dual-land.sh <sha>...` onto `develop` (see skill `dual-land-bugfix`).
- Do not push either branch unless the user asks.
- Do not dual-land unrelated feature work.
